  "conclusion": "Scoped pure-reader source GO at exact96ec779a. All three AD526-PHASE-EVIDENCE findings are resolved. Both request and health bodies obey the external inclusive cap; malformed method/path/owner metadata refuses before unsafe indexing; target invocation/start is connected to the observed phase without rejecting overlapping reads, and a later reread cannot hide an earlier observation of the same trace. The original saved counterexample bytes and unchanged finder script now refuse correctly. No actionable new defect found in this bounded repair.",
  "resolved_findings": [
    {
      "id": "AD526-PHASE-EVIDENCE-1",
      "status": "resolved",
      "file": "tools/serving_cancel_evidence.py",
      "line": 88,
      "code_quote": "require(len(value[\"body\"]) <= maximum_bytes, \"response body exceeds trusted byte cap\")",
      "evidence": "Hydration receives maximum_bytes from validated expected_program.http.max_body_bytes for both attempts and health. Original16580/16443-byte packets with unchanged16384-byte trusted cap now refuse. Exactly16384 bytes remains accepted on both surfaces; no record-supplied limit or tolerance is used."
    },
    {
      "id": "AD526-PHASE-EVIDENCE-2",
      "status": "resolved",
      "file": "tools/serving_cancel_evidence.py",
      "line": 325,
      "code_quote": "require(cancellation[\"invoke_started_ns\"] <= target_invocation[\"started_ns\"]\n        and target_attempt[\"started_ns\"] <= trigger[\"log_read\"][\"finished_ns\"],",
      "evidence": "The original trigger-read-before-target-start packet now refuses. New linkage preserves prior invocation<=HTTP-start bounds, permits reads that straddle HTTP start (including equality at read end), and rejects a target invocation preceding the outer invoke clock. Because read bytes/times are nondecreasing, checking the last completed pre-start prefix catches any earlier complete observation of the selected PID/trace_id even if a later reread was chosen as trigger. Producer trace_elapsed_ns is not compared with host time."
    },
    {
      "id": "AD526-PHASE-EVIDENCE-3",
      "status": "resolved",
      "file": "tools/serving_cancel_evidence.py",
      "line": 246,
      "code_quote": "and row.get(\"path\") == request[\"path\"], \"request owner or method/path differs\")",
      "evidence": "Every request observation now matches trusted owner, POST method and exact request path before the invocation loop indexespath. The original missing-path packet and additional null/list/object/numeric path, method and owner variants raise ServingGateError; no KeyError remains in these controls."
    }
  ],
